    "items": [
      {
        "type": "heading1",
        "verse_numbers": [],
        "lines": [
          "Bildad Speaks"
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          1
        ],
        "lines": [
          "Then Bildad the Shuhite replied:"
        ],
        "rlw_lines": [],
        "np": true
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          2
        ],
        "lines": [
          "How long will you go on saying these things?",
          "Your words are a blast of wind."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": [],
        "np": true
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          3
        ],
        "lines": [
          "Does God pervert justice?",
          "Does the Almighty pervert what is right?"
        ],
        "rlw_lines": [],
        "np": true
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          4
        ],
        "lines": [
          "Since your children sinned against him,",
          "he gave them over to their rebellion."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": [],
        "np": true
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          5
        ],
        "lines": [
          "But if you earnestly seek God",
          "and ask the Almighty for mercy,"
        ],
        "rlw_lines": [],
        "np": true
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          6
        ],
        "lines": [
          "if you are pure and upright,",
          "then he will move even now on your behalf",
          "and restore the home where your righteousness dwells."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": [],
        "np": true
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          7
        ],
        "lines": [
          "Then, even if your beginnings were modest,",
          "your final days will be full of prosperity."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": [],
        "np": true
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          8
        ],
        "lines": [
          "For ask the previous generation,",
          "and pay attention to what their ancestors discovered,"
        ],
        "rlw_lines": [],
        "np": true
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          9
        ],
        "lines": [
          "since we were born only yesterday and know nothing.",
          "Our days on earth are but a shadow."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": [],
        "np": true
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          10
        ],
        "lines": [
          "Will they not teach you and tell you",
          "and speak from their understanding?"
        ],
        "rlw_lines": [],
        "np": true
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          11
        ],
        "lines": [
          "Does papyrus grow where there is no marsh?",
          "Do reeds flourish without water?"
        ],
        "rlw_lines": [],
        "np": true
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          12
        ],
        "lines": [
          "While still uncut shoots,",
          "they would dry up quicker than any other plant."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": [],
        "np": true
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          13
        ],
        "lines": [
          "Such is the destiny of all who forget God;",
          "the hope of the godless will perish."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": [],
        "np": true
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          14
        ],
        "lines": [
          "His source of confidence is fragile;",
          "what he trusts in is a spider’s web."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": [],
        "np": true
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          15
        ],
        "lines": [
          "He leans on his web, but it doesn’t stand firm.",
          "He grabs it, but it does not hold up."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": [],
        "np": true
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          16
        ],
        "lines": [
          "He is a well-watered plant in the sunshine;",
          "his shoots spread out over his garden."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": [],
        "np": true
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          17
        ],
        "lines": [
          "His roots are intertwined around a pile of rocks.",
          "He looks for a home among the stones."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": [],
        "np": true
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          18
        ],
        "lines": [
          "If he is uprooted from his place,",
          "it will deny knowing him, saying, “I never saw you.”"
        ],
        "rlw_lines": [],
        "np": true
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          19
        ],
        "lines": [
          "Surely this is the joy of his way of life;",
          "yet others will sprout from the dust."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": [],
        "np": true
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          20
        ],
        "lines": [
          "Look, God does not reject a person of integrity,",
          "and he will not support evildoers."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": [],
        "np": true
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          21
        ],
        "lines": [
          "He will yet fill your mouth with laughter",
          "and your lips with a shout of joy."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": [],
        "np": true
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          22
        ],
        "lines": [
          "Your enemies will be clothed with shame;",
          "the tent of the wicked will no longer exist."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": [],
        "np": true
      }
    ]
  },
